      "content" : "IMG_6567.JPG",
      "displayName" : "Printed a gear for my coworker's 3D printer. This is probably the 4th time I've printed it. It was pretty difficult to keep the teeth from warping while printing. I finally found out that if I turned the fan on as soon as I started the teeth, it would turn out pretty good. This particular one I printed at 100% infill because he wanted a stronger part. Apparently the teeth part snapped off of the last one I gave him.",
